# Plan

Read AGENTS.md and the docs it links. Then write a plan with:

1. The files you will change.
2. How the change follows DESIGN.md and CODE_STYLE.md.
3. The recorded active branch, the work branch `<type>/<short-kebab-description>` with no tool prefix, and the pull request target. Record the active branch when the task starts. Create the work branch from it and target the PR back into that recorded branch. Target `main` only if `main` was the recorded active branch. Read BRANCHING.md.
4. How you will test it.

Do not edit source files in this step. Do not switch to or merge `main` automatically.
